SUMMARY:Reed Timmer at American Music Theatre
DESCRIPTION:Dominate the Storm: A Heart Pumping Evening with Reed Timmer\, 
 America’s Most Famous Storm Chaser Never Stop Chasing! Experience the ra
 w power of nature through the eyes of Dr. Reed Timmer\, extreme meteorolog
 ist\, scientist\, and one of the world’s most renowned storm chasers. Wi
 th a PhD in meteorology from the University of Oklahoma\, Reed has devoted
  his life to intercepting the planet’s most dangerous storms\, collectin
 g groundbreaking scientific data\, and helping audiences better understand
  how severe weather is changing. Over the past several decades\, Reed has 
 intercepted more than 1\,000 tornadoes and 50 hurricanes\, including EF5 t
 ornadoes and Category 5 hurricanes. He is also the inventor of the Dominat
 ors – armored\, tank-like storm-chasing vehicles equipped with advanced 
 meteorological sensors\, hydraulic anchoring spikes\, drones\, probes\, ba
 lloons\, and even model rockets. Since 2020\, Reed has driven Dominator 3 
 directly into 10 tornadoes\, more than any other person in history. His un
 forgettable expeditions include recording 140 mph winds from inside a Nebr
 aska tornado and launching a trackable sensor into a mile-wide EF4 tornado
  in Kansas. Carried as high as 39\,000 feet and reaching speeds of 190 mph
 \, the sensor captured unprecedented data throughout its 30-mile journey i
 nside the vortex. Currently chasing storms for the National Geographic Cha
 nnel and RadarOmega\, Reed also provides vital real-time reports through t
 raditional and social media. Hear the incredible stories\, witness breatht
 aking footage\, and discover the science behind Earth’s most powerful st
 orms during this heart-pumping live event. For Reed Timmer\, “Never Stop
  Chasing” is more than a motto – it is a way of life. Come Explore Our
  Lancaster Theaters and the Arts Live Theater Live Entertainment Live Musi
